<article class="prose-about">

  <header class="mb-10">
    <h1 class="text-display-sm font-semibold text-greyscale-900 leading-tight">About this citator</h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-md text-greyscale-700 leading-relaxed">
      A preview of a new
      <a href="https://github.com/freelawproject" class="links" target="_blank" rel="noopener">open-source</a>
      citator from
      <a href="https://free.law/" class="links" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Free Law Project</a>.
      The citator reads each opinion with care and, for every treatment, shows the passage behind it and the reasoning that led to it, so you can weigh a treatment at a glance.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-md text-greyscale-700 leading-relaxed">
